S' -> S
S -> F
F -> F Iff G | G
G -> G Implies H | H
H -> H Or I | I
I -> I And J | J
J -> Not J | K
K -> LParen F RParen | True | False | Id
Token:
Iff       : <->
Implies   : ->
Or        : \|
And       : &
Not       : !
LParen    : \(
RParen    : \)
True      : true
False     : false
Id        : [a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9]*
WS        : [ \t\n]+ skip